bodyguard-of-bits (0.5.6-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Targeted hardening pass on bob/checks/logs.py (662 LoC UFW
    log parser) — module explicitly deferred by the v0.5.5
    audit because of regex density. 10 findings from a focused
    sub-agent: 0 critical, 2 important, 8 minor.
  * I-1 — _PRIVATE_IP regex inconsistent with sysinfo.py:
    missed CGNAT (100.64.0.0/10), IPv6 link-local (fe80::/10),
    and produced false positives on any string starting with
    `fc` or `fd`. Replaced with `_is_private_ip(ip)` helper
    delegating to sysinfo._is_private_or_loopback_ipv4/_ipv6
    (single source of truth across the codebase).
  * I-2 — year-rollover silently dropped near-realtime syslog
    events 1s ahead of wall-clock by rolling back a full year
    → entry fell outside cutoff_dt. Fix: 5-minute tolerance
    + snapshot `now` once at top of _parse_log.
  * M-1 — anchored `\[UFW BLOCK6?\]` matcher catches both
    `[UFW BLOCK]` and `[UFW BLOCK6]` (previously the substring
    match silently dropped the IPv6 variant).
  * M-2 — _count_available_days regex restricted to English
    month names (was inflated by non-date leading tokens).
  * M-3 — _GEOIP2_DB_PATHS reordered: all City entries first
    across all dirs, then all Country. _geo_via_geoip2 returns
    on first hit; City always wins richer data.
  * M-4 — geoip2_status() now accepts symlinks like
    _geo_via_geoip2 does. Fixes contradictory "no database
    installed" notice on geoipupdate setups.
  * M-5 — _GEO_CACHE bounded at 2048 entries with FIFO
    eviction via _geo_cache_put() helper.
  * M-6 — LogsSnapshot.from_system reads in binary mode then
    decodes; TextIOBase.tell() returns an opaque cookie per
    Python docs.
  * M-7 — dropped redundant subprocess.TimeoutExpired from
    except tuple (subclass of SubprocessError).
  * M-8 — proto.upper() at parse time prevents a downstream
    lowercase build from silently splitting a bruteforce
    campaign into two sub-groups under threshold.
  * +15 regression tests in tests/test_logs.py (4 new test
    classes: TestPrivateIPDispatch, TestParseTimestampYear-
    Rollover, TestBlockPrefixMatcher, TestProtoNormalisation).
  * 4545 → 4560 tests.
  * Single-module pass, single commit. JSON contract
    (schema_version="1"), 116 EXPLAIN_KEYS — all preserved.
  * Wire output: narrow deltas only on hosts emitting
    [UFW BLOCK6] (now counted) or with non-English locale
    syslog (now accurate days_available).
  * v0.5.7 pending: manage_logs.py + bob/tui/cron.py curses
    TUI (~1920 LoC combined). After that, v0.5.x line is
    fully audited.

