    scores, and --manage-logs history now share a single coloured
    rendering via bob.output.score_bar() — green (score >= 8),
    yellow (5-7), red (0-4). Matches the existing disk partition
    bars in display._disk_bar. Affects display only; --no-color
    continues to neutralise the colours.
